# The Dockerfiles run `pnpm install` and then COPY apps/* over the
# result. Without this, host node_modules land on top of the installed
# ones — symlinks pointing at .pnpm paths that do not exist in the
# image — and the container dies on MODULE_NOT_FOUND. Build output is
# excluded for the same reason: apps/web/Dockerfile builds Nuxt itself.
node_modules
**/node_modules

.nuxt
**/.nuxt
.output
**/.output
dist
**/dist
.vite
**/.vite

.git
.github
coverage
**/coverage

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docker/backups
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
